@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Import all repositories (triggers the timer triggered job manually)
POST http://localhost:7071/admin/functions/import-all-repositories-periodically
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Import a single repository on demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/import-repository/platform-foundation

### Export the dependency graph as Mermaid
GET {{baseUrl}}/export-dependency-graph

### Export the graph connected to a single package (its dependencies and dependents)
GET {{baseUrl}}/export-dependency-graph-for-package/RB.Payments.Contracts
